<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 11,550T of Indian rapeseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 11,550T of Indian rapeseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two South Korean buyers groups, the Big Feed Mills and the Korea Feed Association's members in Pusan, jointly bought on Thursday 11,550 tonnes of Indian rapeseed meal at $118.85 a tonne C&amp;F, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said the buyer groups bought the rapeseed meal from Toepfer with shipment for August 26-September 25.</p>
<p>Arrival was set to the ports of Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
